 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmvq.cu      | 207 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmvq.cuh     |   9 +-
 3 files changed, 279 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

